    "md5": "6693a22cf83026144d63f78981a6466a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2213,
    "chunk_text": "We are on a very strong growth trajectory and if you really look at the growth forecast for the country next year, the nominal growth is projected at 8.5 per cent, which was in the original plan. But, we all need to know that there is a requirement for us to keep the inflation at 5 per cent; that is a requirement under the programme because for a growing country to sustain a healthy inflation is required. The real GDP growth is planned to be at 3 per cent. That is the expectation of the IMF. With that, we are going to get a Government revenue of 15.4 per cent of GDP, which will allow us to keep bringing down our debt servicing cost. The debt servicing team who looks at debt sustainability today have projected that by 2030, the interest bill of the Government will fall from 52 per cent to 35 per cent, which, again, is going to give us a huge cushion, allowing us to invest in health and education. So, this is the trajectory we are going on. So, as a citizen, as a Parliamentarian and as a member of the Government, I urge the Opposition not to have unnecessary discussions, create false information and engage in the fearmongering campaign you carried out before the elections. Do not do it in 2026.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db7\u0dcf \u0dc3\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dba (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees) \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dba\u0ddd\u0dad\u0dba \u0d85\u0db8 \u0dc0\u0dba\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db1\u0dd2, \u0d9a \u0dbd\u0dba \u0d85\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad. \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da0\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dbb\u0d82\u0d9c \u0d85\u0dba\u0dda\u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d82\u0dc4 \u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0ba4\u0bc1\u0bb0\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95 \u0b85\u0bae\u0baa\u0b9a\u0bbf\u0b99\u0bcd\u0bb9) (The Hon. Chathuranga Abeysinghe) So, do not try to steer Sri Lanka away from this trajectory, bringing up topics and non-factual information onto the table to drive fear into investors.\n\nWe are very happy that Colombo Port City Economic Commission and its team are working very hard, that we would be able to fill up this plot of land with investors for the country\u2019s benefit within next the few years with transparency and in accordance with global standards."
  },
