    "chunk_text": "[4.34 p.m.] \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dcf\u0db0\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dd2\u0dba \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dd2\u0dba\u0da5 \u0dc6\u0dba\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0ba9\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0baa\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0ba3\u0bbf \u0bae\u0baa\u0bb8\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bc1\u0bb8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe) (The Hon. Faiszer Musthapha, PC) Hon. Presiding Member, I am privileged to speak on the Port City Economic Commission (Amendment) Bill.\n\nHon. Deputy Minister, as a former Deputy Minister of Investment Promotion in charge of the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka, I would like to remind you that a Director General for the BoI has not been appointed for four years. I believe that the BoI being a very important institution, you would consider making the appointment of the Director General of the BoI expeditiously.\n\nThe Minister is not in the House and Hon. Deputy Minister, I would like to make some constructive criticism with regard to this Bill. I would like to say with responsibility that the proposed Amendments create systematic risks, which could destabilize the domestic economy. Sir, the Amendment to Section 42(1) states that"
